    <div class="service-card featured reveal">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">01 ·</span> SYSTEM AUDIT</span>
        <span class="price">FIXED-SCOPE WEEK · MOST POPULAR</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Find where the work compounds — backed by a real plan.</h3>
        <p>A week mapping your business. Founder interviews. Workflow audit. The 3–5 places AI, SEO, or automation give back real time. Applies across all three focus areas.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Structured founder interviews</li>
          <li>Current-state workflow map</li>
          <li>Ranked opportunity list · effort/impact</li>
          <li>30-day build plan + cost projections</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">FROM MID 4-FIG · LIMITED</span>
        <span class="cta">→ BOOK AUDIT</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal" data-delay="1">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">02 ·</span> BUILD SPRINT</span>
        <span class="price">FIXED-SCOPE BUILD</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>One workflow, productized, shipped fast.</h3>
        <p>Scope agreed upfront. Deployed + documented by end. If the workflow isn't specific enough to one-line, the sprint isn't a fit — and I'll say so on the call.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>One workflow · clear input + output</li>
          <li>Deployed on your Vercel (or mine)</li>
          <li>README + Loom handoff + post-ship support</li>
          <li>You own the code outright</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">FROM MID 4-FIG · LIMITED</span>
        <span class="cta">→ BOOK SPRINT</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal" data-delay="2">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">03 ·</span> ADVISORY RETAINER</span>
        <span class="price">MONTHLY RETAINER</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Reviewer, sounding board, gut check.</h3>
        <p>For founders already building who need a second brain. Async DMs, video reviews, prompt and architecture audits. Not implementation — the feedback that prevents the wrong build.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Regular video calls</li>
          <li>Async Slack review channel</li>
          <li>Cost audits + vendor strategy</li>
          <li>Month-to-month · no lock-in</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">FROM LOW 4-FIG / MO · LIMITED</span>
        <span class="cta">→ ENQUIRE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal" data-delay="3">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">04 ·</span> CUSTOM BUILD</span>
        <span class="price">QUOTE-BASED</span>
